Package: clustEff
Type: Package
Title: Clusters of Effects Curves in Quantile Regression Models
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Gianluca", "Sottile", email = "gianluca.sottile@unipa.it",
           role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-9347-7251")),
    person("Giada", "Adelfio", email = "giada.adelfio@unipa.it", role = "aut"))
Description: Clustering of curves based on a dissimilarity that combines the
    concordance of their shapes and their closeness, as proposed by Sottile
    and Adelfio (2019) <doi:10.1007/s00180-018-0817-8>. The method can be
    applied to the effects curves of quantile regression coefficients models
    fitted with 'qrcm', with univariate or multivariate responses, and to
    curves observed in time, as in functional data analysis. The package also
    implements the clustering of waveforms by trimmed k-means of functional
    principal component scores (Adelfio, Chiodi, D'Alessandro and Luzio, 2011).
